     [38;5;246mSimplest and most durable. Links every account ever used on that browser under one identifier — accept this [39m
     [38;5;246mdeliberately.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Account-scoped
     [38;5;246mResets per user, no cross-account linking. Unavailable on first and failed attempts, which is the main thing you [39m
